For those who have discovered football with Messi/Ronaldo, take a few minutes to look at some out-of-this-world RONALDINHO highlights on YT: you'll end up thinking he has made a deal with the same fellow as Dr. Faustus did!

@KMC Brer Rabbit is old, from the Uncle Remus folktales.
And Doctor Faustus is from a Marlowe play and even older- but I kept assuming the answer for that one would be “devil” or “Satan” because he makes a deal with Mephistopheles. I haven’t actually read/watched the play so I didn’t realize he met Helen.
I was stuck on a lot of the other names though! I don’t follow soccer and am terrible at remembering actors’ names!

